dsh-rea
=======

This package redistributes skill instruction files authored by the REA project.
It contains no REA source code and no third-party binaries.

Upstream project
----------------

  REA (npm package: rea-agents)
  https://github.com/morluto/rea
  Copyright (c) 2026 morluto
  MIT License (see LICENSE-REA in this repository)

Redistributed material
----------------------

The following files under skills/ are verbatim copies of the corresponding
files in the upstream repository's .agents/skills/ directory:

  skills/reverse-engineer-anything/SKILL.md
  skills/reverse-engineer-anything/references/*.md   (6 files)
  skills/rea-tool-design/SKILL.md
  skills/rea-changelog-update/SKILL.md

Source revision of this copy
----------------------------

  repository : https://github.com/morluto/rea
  path       : .agents/skills/
  checkout   : working tree of commit 2f3dee3 (package version 6.4.0)
  copied at  : 2026-10-16

Changes
-------

No changes were made to the copied file contents. At runtime, lib/index.js
reads each SKILL.md, parses its YAML frontmatter for the skill name and
description, and serves the body with the frontmatter block removed, because
the skill registry supplies those fields separately.

Refresh with:  node sync-skills.mjs <path-to-rea-checkout>
